  triage:correctionNote "quality-mgr (2026-07-27): QA-1 for PR #669 (docs/phase-ai-readiness-triage @ b5ddce8a). docs/project-plan.md:951 header corrected from 'Phase AI: PLANNED -- AI.8-AI.11 in progress' to '[ACTIVE -- implementation through AI.30; readiness blocked]', with the sprint table (project-plan.md:971-1003) listing AI.1 through AI.30 all complete and explicit text stating this implementation status does not close the phase pending readiness.md's physical two-Mac/Mac<->Windows peer evidence. The stale AI.14 preflight-failure note in readiness.md is now clearly scoped as historical/superseded (readiness.md:50-63), citing the current canonical PostWriteRouter routing path as live evidence instead. docs/plans/phase-ai/readiness.md status:blocked (line 3) and the AI10-TWOMAC-001/AI10-WINDOWS-001 BLOCKED rows (lines 40-41) and Release blockers section (lines 43-48) were independently confirmed UNCHANGED/unweakened by all 3 reviewers. All 3 QA-1 reviewers (req-qa, arch-qa, ruthless-boundary-qa) independently confirmed PASS with 0 blocking findings. CI green 8/8 legs." .